name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-postassessment-q4_2026-pilot_2026'

question 'Which scenario best demonstrates a student appropriately decomposing a task between human and AI contributions?'

right 'A student brainstorms the argument for their essay, uses AI to suggest counterarguments they might not have considered, then evaluates each counterargument themselves before deciding which to include.'
wrong 'A student asks AI to write the full essay, then changes a few words so it sounds more like them.'
wrong 'A student writes the essay entirely without AI, then asks AI to give it a grade.'
wrong 'A student uses AI to pick their essay topic, structure, evidence, and conclusion, then types it up.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

